{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/Readium\/Search","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Searching a publication","roleHeading":"Article"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/Readium"]]},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Checking if a publication is searchable","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Checking-if-a-publication-is-searchable"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Not every publication has a search service attached. Check "},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"isSearchable","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" before offering a search UI."}]},{"code":["guard publication.isSearchable else {","    \/\/ Hide or disable the search UI.","    return","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Performing a search","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Performing-a-search"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"publication.search(query:options:)"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to start a new search. This method returns a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SearchResult<SearchIterator>"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — either a cursor to page through results, or a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SearchError"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let result = await publication.search(query: \"red panda\")","","switch result {","case .success(let iterator):","    \/\/ Use the iterator to page through results.","case .failure(let error):","    handleSearchError(error)","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"Iterating through results","anchor":"Iterating-through-results","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SearchIterator"}]},{"text":" is a cursor that fetches results one page at a time. Each page is a ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocatorCollection"}]},{"text":" containing an array of ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Locator"}]},{"text":" values, one per match.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Call ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"iterator.next()"}]},{"text":" to retrieve the next page. It returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on success when all results have been exhausted, or ","type":"text"},{"code":".failure","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if a read error occurs.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["while let page = try await iterator.next().get() {","    for locator in page.locators {","        print(\"Found result at: \\(locator.href)\")","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To navigate directly to a result, pass the locator to the Navigator:"}]},{"code":["await navigator.go(to: locator)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Pagination strategies","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Pagination-strategies"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Results may arrive in pages to progressively load results. In practice there are two common approaches:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Background load:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" start a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Task"},{"type":"text","text":" that accumulates every result progressively. Simple to implement; the full list updates every time a new page is fetched."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"On-scroll load:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" hold onto the iterator and call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"next()"},{"type":"text","text":" only when the user scrolls to the bottom of the current batch. This keeps memory and CPU usage low, at the cost of slightly more state management."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Grouping-results-by-section","level":3,"text":"Grouping results by section","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"locator.title"}]},{"text":" is the title of the table of contents entry that contains the match — for example, a chapter or section title. Use it to group consecutive results that fall within the same entry:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["var sections: [(title: String?, locators: [Locator])] = []","for locator in page.locators {","    if locator.title == sections.last?.title {","        sections[sections.count - 1].locators.append(locator)","    } else {","        sections.append((title: locator.title, locators: [locator]))","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This preserves order and keeps sections with the same title distinct when they are not consecutive.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Displaying-a-result-snippet","level":3,"text":"Displaying a result snippet","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"locator.text"}]},{"text":" contains the matched text and its surrounding context:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"highlight"},{"type":"text","text":" — the exact string that matched the query."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"before"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"after"},{"type":"text","text":" — a short snippet of text on either side of the match."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Here is a SwiftUI view that renders a single result with the matched text in bold:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct SearchResultRow: View {","    let locator: Locator","","    var body: some View {","        Text(snippet)","    }","","    private var snippet: AttributedString {","        var result = AttributedString()","        if let before = locator.text?.before {","            result += AttributedString(before)","        }","        if let highlight = locator.text?.highlight {","            var bold = AttributedString(highlight)","            bold.font = .body.bold()","            result += bold","        }","        if let after = locator.text?.after {","            result += AttributedString(after)","        }","        return result","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In a real UI you will typically want to truncate ","type":"text"},{"code":"before","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"after","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" so the UI stays compact.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Search-options","level":2,"text":"Search options","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass a ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SearchOptions"}]},{"text":" value to ","type":"text"},{"code":"search(query:options:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to override the defaults. Any option you leave as ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" falls back to the default behavior.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let result = await publication.search(","    query: \"Red Panda\",","    options: SearchOptions(","        caseSensitive: true,","        diacriticSensitive: false","    )",")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The full set of available options:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Option"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Type"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Built-in"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"caseSensitive"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bool?"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":", the search distinguishes upper- and lower-case letters."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"diacriticSensitive"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bool?"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":", accented and unaccented letters are treated as distinct."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"wholeWord"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bool?"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":", only complete words are matched, not substrings."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"exact"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bool?"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":", the query is matched exactly, including stop words and word order."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"language"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Language?"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Overrides the publication’s language for this search."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"regularExpression"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bool?"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":", the query is interpreted as a regular expression."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"otherOptions"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"[String: String]"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"–"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Custom options specific to the search service implementation."}]}]]],"type":"table"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Built-in"}]},{"text":" column indicates whether the default Readium configuration handles the option. Options marked ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No"}]},{"text":" are silently ignored unless you provide a custom algorithm that implements them.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Supported-options","level":3,"text":"Supported options","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Before displaying search-option controls – e.g. a case sensitivity toggle, or regex mode – inspect ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"publication.searchOptions"}]},{"text":" to learn which options the service actually supports. An option whose value is ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"no